        "original_id": "31144838-a8c0-5efb-b51c-117e1d49ce85",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mariqueen Maandig Reznor, Pelle Almqvist, Trent Reznor, Atticus Ross\n- Projects: An Omen EP, Welcome Oblivion, Ice Age\n- Groups: Nine Inch Nails, How to Destroy Angels\n\nFacts:\n- Pelle Almqvist was born on 29 May 1978 and is a Swedish singer and songwriter also known as Howlin' Pelle Almqvist.\n- Mariqueen Maandig Reznor was born on April 5, 1981 and is a Filipino American musician and singer-songwriter.\n- Trent Reznor, Mariqueen Maandig, and Atticus Ross produced An Omen EP.\n- Various tracks from An Omen EP were later issued on the 2013 debut album Welcome Oblivion.\n- Ice Age is a song by the American post-industrial group How to Destroy Angels from its second release, An Omen EP.\n- Trent Reznor is the frontman of Nine Inch Nails.",
